        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"Hodges\"]\n\nWe were playing against Akash&#39;bhuta last nigth and I wasn&#39;t sure whether or not I could use my base power as Nightmist due to it requiring me to damage myself and one of the limbs, the brambles I think, prevents the lowest HP player from doing damage. &nbsp;Does that make it so I can&#39;t use my power?\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe power does not require you to do damage. There is no &quot;and&quot; connecting the two parts. You do the damage. You draw two cards. If you can&#39;t deal damage, the second coniditon still applies. NightMist loves the brambles. We often ask the other players to leave one out just so NightMist&nbsp; can use her base power more freely.\n",
